profile:
Italian punk hardcore band from Foggia, Apulia. 
Brandelli D'Odio born on summer 1993 at Piscina Okkupata (squatted swimming pool) in Foggia, formed by Raffaele after the split of [a=Bandiera Dell'Odio]; actives till summer 1997, Brandelli D'Odio was a kind of open band involved in hardcore punk, industrial music, experimental theatre, squatting social centers, benefit gigs for anarchist prisoners, Animal Liberation Front and more; 
The band was an open project, lots of people collaborated
